  "description": "We have waited patiently for stock setups and these 2 stood out 😊",
  "body_html": "<p>Its been an absolutely painful month…but alas…we are getting some green on the charts. No…we did not catch the bottom…that is NEVER the goal. The goal is to latch onto an early developing trend….and hang on as long as possible. Minimizing risk as we can, day by day. </p><p>Now just because we are making some purchases, does NOT mean we are in safe waters. However, as the markets <em><strong>trend </strong></em>towards our speculative direction (up), we will add to winning positions and pick up new positions. Gradually betting heavier, if we notice that a winning streak is developing. We do not go full portfolio on any one position…we gradually increase our exposure, which will limit downside losses in our total portfolio account equity. </p><p>The VIX remains elevated at 28; recall that under roughly 22 is generally considered “safe calm bull markets”. We do have gaps to the upside up to 36 that have not been filled. There are gaps to the downside as well….so do not expect an “easy ride”. </p><p><em><strong>These 2 stocks are somewhat unexpected, yet have trended positively or held price relatively well in comparison the S&amp;P 500 and have shown initial breakouts… </strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hWf4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a74ca3a-983e-4e72-abf2-bb4250cbcd8d_1398x823.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hWf4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a74ca3a-983e-4e72-abf2-bb4250cbcd8d_1398x823.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hWf4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F